27701      * Separate Curves and Intercepts;
27702      proc transreg data=Gas solve ss2 additive plots=(transformation obp);
27703      model identity(nox) = class(Fuel / zero=none) |
27704      spline(EqRatio / nknots=4 after);
27705      run;

NOTE: Since the model contains SMOOTH, BSPLINE, PBSPLINE, or a CLASS expansion with ZERO=NONE, a model with an implicit intercept is fit.
